The '''Isle of Bones''' is an island located south-west of the [[Void Knights' Outpost]]. It requires 56{{boostable|no}} [[Sailing]] to moor on.

This small island consists of several level 45 [[skeletons]], [[dead tree]]s, several [[Big bones]] spawns, several [[Bones]] spawns, and a small gulf where players can disembark at the [[mooring point]]. There are also several one-off activities:
*A [[Meaty Aura Logist]] on for [[Sea charting]].
*A [[medallion fragment]] can be found by investigating the [[Cauldron (Isle of Bones)|cauldron]].
*A [[Small key (Isle of Bones)|small key]] can be dug up one tile south of the shell west of the mooring point.

